Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the assumption that the MCP251x CAN controller would always enter configuration mode within a fixed time frame (5ms) after a reset. Some boards require more time to power up, leading to premature failure in detecting the device's state, resulting in an error being returned even when the device was still initializing.

